7592186551167 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186550591 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551167 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186550605 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551167 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186550845 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551167 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186550955 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551167 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551167 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551167 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186550415 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551167 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "a916e5ab-d2bf-5c35-99df-efcacc3f8e56" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551260 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186551167 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551260 #edb/ref 1069 "q-73818" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551260 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551260 #edb/ref 1071 "$\\frac{9{x}^{4}+12{x}^{3}-25}{3x-5}=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551260 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "343c6002-3a70-5903-a244-0acddb5859ce" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551260 #edb/ref 1074 "We can calculate $\\frac{9{x}^{4}+12{x}^{3}-25}{3x-5}$ using synthetic division.\n\nFor synthetic division to work, we need the coefficient of $x$ in the denominator to be equal to $1.$ So first, we factor the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{9{x}^{4}+12{x}^{3}-25}{3x-5} & =\\frac{9{x}^{4}+12{x}^{3}-25}{3(x-\\frac{5}{3})} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\frac{9{x}^{4}+12{x}^{3}-25}{(x-\\frac{5}{3})}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCarrying out the synthetic division process on $\\frac{9{x}^{4}+12{x}^{3}-25}{(x-\\frac{5}{3})}$, we arrive at the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {x}^{4} & {x}^{3} & {x}^{2} & {x}^{1} & {x}^{0} \\\\ \\frac{5}{3} & 9 & 12 & 0 & 0 & -25 \\\\  & ↓ & 15 & 45 & 75 & 125 \\\\  & 9 & 27 & 45 & 75 & 100\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\frac{9{x}^{4}+12{x}^{3}-25}{(x-\\frac{5}{3})} & =\\frac{1}{3}(9{x}^{3}+27{x}^{2}+45x+75+\\frac{100}{(x-\\frac{5}{3})}) \\\\  & =3{x}^{3}+9{x}^{2}+15x+25+\\frac{100}{3x-5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, our final result is\n\n$$\n\\frac{9{x}^{4}+12{x}^{3}-25}{3x-5}=3{x}^{3}+9{x}^{2}+15x+25+\\frac{100}{3x-5}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551300 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186551082 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551300 #edb/ref 1069 "q-18577" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551300 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551300 #edb/ref 1071 "$\\frac{-{x}^{4}-3{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+x+1}{x+4}=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551300 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "84195c6c-e13d-58c7-8f62-b8364f00b637" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551300 #edb/ref 1074 "We can calculate $\\frac{-{x}^{4}-3{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+x+1}{x+4}$ using synthetic division.\n\nCarrying out the synthetic division process, we arrive at the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {x}^{4} & {x}^{3} & {x}^{2} & {x}^{1} & {x}^{0} \\\\ -4 & -1 & -3 & 4 & 1 & 1 \\\\  & ↓ & 4 & -4 & 0 & -4 \\\\  & -1 & 1 & 0 & 1 & -3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-{x}^{4}-3{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+x+1}{x+4}=-{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}+1-\\frac{3}{x+4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551308 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186551129 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551308 #edb/ref 1069 "q-18548" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551308 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551308 #edb/ref 1071 "$\\frac{4{x}^{4}+12{x}^{3}+5{x}^{2}+16x+7}{x+3}=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551308 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "8ccbfa58-d595-551b-aac0-8c85b253cfbe" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551308 #edb/ref 1074 "We can calculate $\\frac{4{x}^{4}+12{x}^{3}+5{x}^{2}+16x+7}{x+3}$ using synthetic division.\n\nCarrying out the synthetic division process, we arrive at the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {x}^{4} & {x}^{3} & {x}^{2} & {x}^{1} & {x}^{0} \\\\ -3 & 4 & 12 & 5 & 16 & 7 \\\\  & ↓ & -12 & 0 & -15 & -3 \\\\  & 4 & 0 & 5 & 1 & 4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4{x}^{4}+12{x}^{3}+5{x}^{2}+16x+7}{x+3}=4{x}^{3}+5x+1+\\frac{4}{x+3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551384 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "340e3ed6-35e3-5d45-bca2-83d91ae792ee" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551384 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186551260 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551386 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186551384 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551386 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "34f2531b-3118-5542-84d9-9e90e68fa910" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551386 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186551300 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551403 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186551386 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551403 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "5996360f-63a5-5e3f-a0ef-bac173ffcb52" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186551403 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186551308 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
